        Name: 持续发射 (Spawn Rate)
        Description: 控制每秒持续发射的粒子数量 (火焰/浓烟/喷泉/火花流)
        Stage: Emitter
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SpawnRate]\n    // 由系统发射调度器根据 SpawnRate 与 dt 累积并生成新图元\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: SpawnRate
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 18
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20000
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 每秒持续发射粒子数 (/s)
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: EmissionRate
      - Id: mod.spawn.init_particle
        Name: 粒子初始化 (Initialize Particle)
        Description: 设定图元诞生时的基准生命周期、初始尺寸与渐变颜色
        Stage: Spawn
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: InitializeParticle]\n    p.MaxLife = u_Lifetime;\n    p.Life = u_Lifetime;\n    p.Size = float2(u_SizeStart);\n    p.Color = u_ColorStart;\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: Lifetime
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 3
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.00999999978
            Max: 99999
            Step: 0.100000001
            Tooltip: 粒子存活基准寿命 (秒)
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: Lifetime
          - Name: SizeStart
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.349999994
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.00999999978
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 诞生初始尺寸
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: SizeStart
          - Name: SizeEnd
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1.79999995
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.00999999978
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 消亡终末尺寸
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: SizeEnd
          - Name: ColorStart
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [1, 0.800000012, 0.300000012, 1]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 初始 RGBA 颜色
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: ColorEnd
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [1, 0.200000003, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 消亡 RGBA 颜色
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.spawn.cone
        Name: 圆锥发射 (Cone Spawn)
        Description: 按圆锥顶角与底面半径空间分布发射粒子并赋予初始初速度
        Stage: Spawn
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: ConeSpawn] 圆锥发射空间分布算法\n    float angleRad = radians(u_ConeAngle);\n    float u = Hash1D(particleId * 3 + 1);\n    float v = Hash1D(particleId * 3 + 2);\n    float phi = 6.2831853f * u;\n    float sinTheta = sin(angleRad) * sqrt(v);\n    float cosTheta = sqrt(max(0.0f, 1.0f - sinTheta * sinTheta));\n    float3 localDir = float3(sinTheta * cos(phi), cosTheta, sinTheta * sin(phi));\n    \n    float diskR = u_ConeRadius * sqrt(Hash1D(particleId * 3 + 0));\n    float diskPhi = 6.2831853f * Hash1D(particleId * 3 + 7);\n    p.Position = float3(diskR * cos(diskPhi), 0.0f, diskR * sin(diskPhi));\n    \n    float speed = u_InitialSpeed + (Hash1D(particleId * 7 + 3) * 2.0f - 1.0f) * u_SpeedVariance;\n    p.Velocity = localDir * speed;\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: ConeAngle
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 16
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 90
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 圆锥半角 (度)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: ConeRadius
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.150000006
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 10
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 底部圆盘半径 (米)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: InitialSpeed
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1.20000005
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 50
            Step: 0.200000003
            Tooltip: 发射初始基准速率 (m/s)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: SpeedVariance
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.100000001
            Tooltip: 发射速度随机扰动范围
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.gravity
        Name: 重力场 (Gravity Force)
        Description: 对粒子施加恒定三维重力加速度向量
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: GravityForce]\n    p.Velocity += u_Gravity.xyz * dt;\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: Gravity
            Type: 2
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 1.20000005, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: -50
            Max: 50
            Step: 0.200000003
            Tooltip: 三维重力向量 [Gx, Gy, Gz]
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.drag
        Name: 空气阻力 (Air Drag)
        Description: 模拟流体介质空气阻尼，阻碍粒子高速运动
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: LinearDrag]\n    p.Velocity *= max(0.0f, 1.0f - u_LinearDrag * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: LinearDrag
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.800000012
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 10
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 空气阻尼系数
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.rotation_over_life
        Name: 平面旋转与角速度 (Rotation Over Life)
        Description: 控制粒子初始旋转朝向与随寿命演进的持续角速度 (rad/s)
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Rotation Over Life]\n    p.Rotation += u_RotationSpeed * dt;\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: RotationSpeed
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.699999988
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: -30
            Max: 30
            Step: 0.100000001
            Tooltip: 自转角速度 (rad/s)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: InitialRotation
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: -3.14159012
            Max: 3.14159012
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 初始旋转角度 (rad)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.scale_over_life
        Name: 尺寸随寿命缩放 (Scale Over Life)
        Description: 基于归一化存活进度 (0~1) 控制粒子尺寸膨胀扩散或缩小消亡
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Scale Over Life]\n    float normLife = clamp(1.0f - (p.Life / max(0.001f, p.MaxLife)), 0.0f, 1.0f);\n    p.Size = lerp(u_StartScale, u_EndScale, normLife);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: StartScale
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0.349999994
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 初始尺寸乘子
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: EndScale
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 2
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 消亡前终止尺寸乘子
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.color_over_life
        Name: 色彩淡入淡出 (Color Over Life)
        Description: 基于粒子存活进度进行色彩与透明度渐变过渡
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Color Over Life]\n    float normLife = clamp(1.0f - (p.Life / max(0.001f, p.MaxLife)), 0.0f, 1.0f);\n    p.Color = lerp(u_ColorStart, u_ColorEnd, normLife);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: ColorStart
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0.400000006, 0.379999995, 0.360000014, 0.5]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.00999999978
            Tooltip: 初始出生颜色 (RGBA)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: ColorEnd
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0.150000006, 0.150000006, 0.150000006, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.00999999978
            Tooltip: 终止消亡颜色 (RGBA)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.solve_velocity
        Name: "物理积分与生命周期 (Solve Velocity & Life)"
        Description: 欧拉物理速度积分更新位置，递减生命周期并计算归一化时间
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SolveVelocity] 物理欧拉积分与消亡\n    p.Position += p.Velocity * dt;\n    p.Life -= dt;\n    if (u_SpeedDamping > 0.001f)\n        p.Velocity *= max(0.0f, 1.0f - u_SpeedDamping * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: SpeedDamping
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 5
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 物理速度阻尼
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.render.sprite
