        Name: 单点发射 (Point Spawn)
        Description: 从单一原点向指定方向发射粒子
        Stage: Spawn
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: PointSpawn]\n    p.Position = float3(0.0f);\n    p.Velocity = float3(0.0f, u_Speed, 0.0f);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: Speed
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 5
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 50
            Step: 0.200000003
            Tooltip: 发射速度
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.color_over_life
        Name: 色彩淡入淡出 (Color Over Life)
        Description: 基于粒子存活进度进行色彩与透明度渐变过渡
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: Color Over Life]\n    float normLife = clamp(1.0f - (p.Life / max(0.001f, p.MaxLife)), 0.0f, 1.0f);\n    p.Color = lerp(u_ColorStart, u_ColorEnd, normLife);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: ColorStart
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [1, 0.449999988, 0.0500000007, 0.800000012]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.00999999978
            Tooltip: 初始出生颜色 (RGBA)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: ColorEnd
            Type: 3
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [1, 0.449999988, 0.0500000007, 0.800000012]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 0.00999999978
            Tooltip: 终止消亡颜色 (RGBA)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.update.solve_velocity
        Name: "物理积分与生命周期 (Solve Velocity & Life)"
        Description: 欧拉物理速度积分更新位置，递减生命周期并计算归一化时间
        Stage: Update
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SolveVelocity] 物理欧拉积分与消亡\n    p.Position += p.Velocity * dt;\n    p.Life -= dt;\n    if (u_SpeedDamping > 0.001f)\n        p.Velocity *= max(0.0f, 1.0f - u_SpeedDamping * dt);\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: SpeedDamping
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 0
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 5
            Step: 0.0500000007
            Tooltip: 物理速度阻尼
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
      - Id: mod.render.sprite
        Name: 精灵渲染器 (Sprite Renderer)
        Description: 配置图元混合模式 (加法/半透)、自发光强度与面片朝向 (相机对齐/水平地面)
        Stage: Render
        Enabled: true
        IsCustom: false
        SlangSource: "\n    // [Module: SpriteRenderer]\n    // 驱动 GPU 混合模式与几何着色器面片顶点朝向生成\n"
        Parameters:
          - Name: BlendMode
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 混合模式 (0=半透 AlphaBlend, 1=加法 Additive)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: FacingMode
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 1
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0
            Max: 1
            Step: 1
            Tooltip: 面片朝向 (0=Billboard相机对齐, 1=Horizontal地面水平)
            IsExposed: false
            ExposedName: ""
          - Name: EmissiveBoost
            Type: 0
            FloatVal: 2.79999995
            VecVal: [0, 0, 0, 0]
            IntVal: 0
            BoolVal: false
            Min: 0.100000001
            Max: 20
            Step: 0.100000001
            Tooltip: HDR 自发光倍率 (促发辉光 Bloom)
            IsExposed: true
            ExposedName: EmissiveBoost